goodwatercap-fever:greenhouse:4890337101.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Growth is the team managing the engine responsible for driving the Fever growth ambition across all markets. Our goal is to ensure our partners thrive by leveraging Fever’s world-leading data, marketing, and product technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We aim to fully understand the Fever business and work collaboratively with other teams to achieve the growth ambitions of Fever and our partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As a Growth Strategy Manager, you will be a key architect of Fever’s expansion across the Brazil region. You won&#39;t just execute projects; you will own the growth roadmap, defining how we build our business model and partner portfolio. Working at the intersection of data, marketing, and business development, you will lead key projects and partners that drive our success in Brazil.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Growth and Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and lead the business plan for key Brazil expansion areas and partners. While driving projects with key impact on product prioritization and localized revenue optimization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a lead advisor to our top-tier strategic partners. Leverage Fever’s proprietary data and technology to help our partners succeed and grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Move beyond analysis to implementation. Lead projects that turn complex data into actionable business cases, and take full accountability for moving key business metrics (CAC, LTV, ROI).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Optimize new business streams and cross-functional workflows. You will ensure that as we scale, our operations remain lean, efficient, and capable of supporting rapid growth across diverse markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with key regional stakeholders (i.e. Country and Regional General Managers) across our key APAC markets to help them build business cases for local marketing and technology needs within Fevers global product and marketing capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 4-5 years of experience in an analytical business role with experience in strategy consulting, fast growing startups, or investment banking, a plus, including a proven track record of leading complex projects and delivering measurable business growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background&lt;/strong&gt;: Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Maths, Statistics, Data Analytics, or Strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to leverage data, make strategic business decisions, and craft convincing narratives for senior stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent interpersonal skills and a demonstrated ability to manage, influence, and align diverse stakeholders across different cultures and disciplines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive problem-solver who can handle ambiguity and make high-stakes decisions. Passionate about industry trends and eager to explore new growth opportunities in a fast-paced, evolving environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in English, Portuguese and Spanish is a must.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in SQL, Python, or R is preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Willing to relocate to Buenos Aires, Argentina.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love it Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attractive compensation package, including stock options to reward your contributions and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40% discount on all Fever events and experiences + free Candlelight voucher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 days of paid annual leave to support your well-being and personal time outside of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health &amp;amp; dental insurance: OSDE 410 plan fully covered by Fever.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellhub membership for gym and wellness access: 100% covered by Fever up to the Silver plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language learning support: English and Spanish lessons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup: home office friendly with a central Buenos Aires office location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic international team: a young, talented group creating a great work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fever is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workspace where everyone&#39;s background and ideas count. Our main goal is to find the best possible talent regardless of place of birth, racial or ethnic origin, gender, gender identity, religion, opinion, sexual orientation, disability, pregnancy, marital status, age or caring responsibilities. We encourage everyone to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require any kind of accommodation during the selection process please contact our Talent team so we can help you by providing a welcoming and seamless journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to know more about how Fever processes your personal data, click here&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cIzPP7QJGht5LAGKkRGQP8fxh-Z4Mfph2JhGSvhd8zM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y7rpsj7nzave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fever - Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

greaterwashingtonpartnership-red-cell-pa.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Red Cell Partners is an incubation firm building and investing in rapidly scalable technology-led companies that are bringing revolutionary advancements to market in three distinct practice areas: healthcare, cyber, and national security. United by a shared sense of duty and deep belief in the power of innovation, Red Cell is developing powerful tools and solutions to address our Nation’s most pressing problems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Test Engineer – Power Electronics / IVR Validation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum of 3 days a week in the office in Torrance, CA.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(Hybrid role)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Claros&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Claros enables Grid-to-Chip power infrastructure solutions for next generation Data Centers.&amp;nbsp; Our mission is to transform power management to meet the global energy demand created by big data, artificial intelligence and ML.&amp;nbsp; Through our innovative power delivery platform, our technology helps next generation data centers implement and operate server platforms that identify, control, and optimize power and energy management systems to meet real-world end user demands. We serve government and commercial customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are open-minded, fast paced, problem solvers that value open dialogue and candor. Our passion is to challenge the status-quo and we embrace transformational thinking.&amp;nbsp; Our response is never “no, but….” instead “yes, if….”.&amp;nbsp; We are mindful of our personal and organizational blinders and try to build an environment where our team members are At Their Best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Test Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to own lab and bench activities for the IVR team, with a strong focus on Engineering Validation Test (EVT) and Design Validation Test (DVT).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for developing and executing test plans, verifying compliance to product requirements and specifications, validating real-world hardware performance, bringing up new evaluation platforms, automating measurements, and driving debug and root-cause analysis. You will work closely with design, systems, packaging, digital, and packaging teams to ensure IVR products meet performance, reliability, and readiness targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for a candidate who thrives in a fast-moving hardware environment and wants direct impact on the development of advanced power delivery technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own bench-based verification and validation of IVR hardware across prototype and pre-production phases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead execution of EVT and DVT for integrated voltage regulator products, evaluation boards, and demonstrator platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute test plans that verify compliance to electrical, thermal, functional, and protection requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate real-world product performance across operating conditions, corner cases, and intended use environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform hardware bring-up, debug, and characterization of evaluation boards and system platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define pass/fail criteria, test coverage, and readiness metrics for validation milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and analyze tests for:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;regulation accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;load transient response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;startup and shutdown behavior&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fault response and protection features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;telemetry accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;thermal performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;control behavior and stability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug issues related to power delivery, board functionality, signal integrity, telemetry, and control interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain automated test setups and scripts using Python, LabVIEW, MATLAB, or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate oscilloscopes, electronic loads, power supplies, DMMs, DAQs, power analyzers, and thermal instrumentation into repeatable test environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate data logging, post-processing, visualization, and report generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development of test fixtures, interface boards, and bench infrastructure for scalable and repeatable verification and validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to resolve failures, improve coverage, and drive closure of validation issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate clear test reports and communicate findings, risks, and recommendations to engineering stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reliability and environmental stress testing, including thermal cycling, load transients, and power-on stress as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Electrical Engineering, Electronics Engineering, Computer Engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in test engineering, validation engineering, verification engineering, power electronics, or hardware development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with bench testing, hardware bring-up, and debug&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with EVT, DVT, product verification, specification compliance testing, or hardware validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of power electronics, analog circuits, DC-DC converters, voltage regulators, or power management systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with standard lab instrumentation including oscilloscopes, power supplies, electronic loads, DMMs, and power analyzers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with test automation using Python, LabVIEW, MATLAB, C/C++, or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging, root-cause analysis, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a collaborative, fast-paced engineering environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Would Be Helpful&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience verifying and validating high-current, low-voltage power delivery systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in IVR, VRM, POL regulators, PMICs, or other power conversion products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with I2C, SPI, PMBus, or similar interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with thermal characterization, transient testing, control loop analysis, and protection feature verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI hardware, data center power, advanced packaging, or high-performance compute systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building reusable test infrastructure, automated test frameworks, and requirement-driven test coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career track opportunity with potential for rapid advancement with strong performance as the firm grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% employer paid, comprehensive health care including medical, dental, and vision for you and your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid maternity and paternity for 14 weeks at employees&#39; normal pay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited PTO, with management approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional development and continued learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional 401K, FSA, and equity incentives available.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp; $130,000-$180,000.&amp;nbsp; This represents the typical salary range for this position based on experience, skills, and other factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Red Cell Partners Benefits:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;For full-time roles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Career track opportunity with potential for rapid advancement with&amp;nbsp;strong performance&amp;nbsp;as the firm grows&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
