&lt;h2&gt;We’re looking for someone with a strong understanding of procurement processes, solid negotiation skills, and a genuine curiosity and passion for the influencer ecosystem.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;In this role, you’ll work closely with influencers and a wide range of partners, leveraging your expertise in procurement and cost management to negotiate project-based and annual partnership terms that directly impact collaboration outcomes and business results.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct cost analysis and lead price negotiations for projects with KOLs and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute negotiation strategies tailored to different types of collaborations, including project-based discounts, annual partnership terms, and incentive or rebate mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage historical pricing and collaboration records for KOLs and partners to support negotiation decisions and cost rationalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with internal teams to ensure procurement processes, pricing confirmation, and payment terms are executed smoothly and efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market trends and changes in the KOL and partner landscape, and provide strategic recommendations on procurement planning, annual partnerships, and cost optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of consistent negotiation frameworks and communication principles internally, ensuring alignment and efficiency across multiple projects and partnership scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of experience in procurement and/or influencer marketing–related roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation and communication skills, with the ability to clearly articulate positions and build long-term partnerships among multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of cost structures and strong numerical sensitivity, with the ability to evaluate costs and optimization opportunities from a holistic project perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team player with strong cross-functional communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to manage time effectively and maintain high execution quality in a fast-paced, multi-project environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with social media platforms and the influencer industry landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate to upper-intermediate English proficiency, with the ability to handle day-to-day work communication, read documents, and manage written correspondence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance review (2 times a year)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sick, compassionate and special leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All-hands meeting at overseas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TGIF, monthly birthday and other fun events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

mbaexchange-adasia:greenhouse:7656974.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a fast-moving adtech leader and bridge the gap between business strategy and technical reality. As a Research and Analytics Intern, you will leverage &quot;vibe coding&quot; and cutting-edge LLMs to ship rapid prototypes and transform messy data into actionable insights that drive real-world ROI.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build quick internal tools, data scrapers, and automation scripts using LLMs like ChatGPT, Claude, and Cursor to ship POCs in days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Translate ambiguous marketing and business questions into structured analytical approaches and clean large datasets for actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Research and test new AI agents and prompt engineering techniques to automate content workflows, sentiment analysis, and lead scoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Communicate complex insights through data storytelling and build responsive dashboards using Looker Studio, Tableau, or Streamlit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A student able to commit to a 6-month full time internship with relevant coursework in AI and data analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proficient in using LLMs, AI agents, and &quot;vibe coding&quot; tools (Claude, Cursor) to build fast POCs in Python and SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Possess an agile mindset with a high &quot;figure-it-out&quot; factor and a radical curiosity to self-learn new technologies in hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Skill in transforming messy datasets into clear narratives and visual dashboards using BI platforms like Looker Studio or Streamlit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A strong grasp of marketing funnels, KPIs, and business logic to bridge the gap between strategy and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

mbaexchange-bayada:greenhouse:8355060002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2 style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$21-25/hour&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt; is currently seeking experienced &lt;strong&gt;Home Health Aide, HHA&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to complete home care&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;visits&lt;/strong&gt; to clients located throughout the Westchester, Younkers area.&amp;nbsp; As a Home Health Aide, you will be an integral member of a multi-disciplinary health care team that provides home health aide, skilled nursing and rehabilitative care to clients, affording them the opportunity to receive the medical care required to remain at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;//www.youtube.com/embed/eXVt3U33dtg&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
