&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sun &amp;amp; Scrubs: Immediate Summer Openings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work in your neighborhood and give back to your community. We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care delivered with &lt;em&gt;compassion, excellence, and reliability!! &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Columbia Skilled Office has an immediate need for &lt;strong&gt;PCA- Personal Care Aides&amp;nbsp;to care for our Pediatric Clients.&lt;/strong&gt; As a member of our home care team, you will be valued, respected, and heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/eXVt3U33dtg&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA offers PCA- Personal Care Aides:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling to fit your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short commute times – we try to match you to opportunities near your home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive work environment and the tools you need to do your job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A stable working environment – we invest in our care team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24 / 7 on call clinical manager support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for PCA- Personal Care Aides:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum one year work experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities for PCA- Personal Care Aides:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activities of daily living&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Light housekeeping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bathing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grooming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Toileting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nail care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Range of motion / exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transfers / use of mechanical lifting devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oral feeding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vital sign checks: temperature, pulse, respiration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Management Tasks: laundry, meal preparation, bed making etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting with ambulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medication assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA recognizes and rewards our PCA- Personal Care Aides who set and maintain the highest standards of excellence. Join our caring team today!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 1975 by J. Mark Baiada, BAYADA Home Health Care provides nursing, rehabilitative, therapeutic, hospice, and assistive care services to children, adults, and seniors in the comfort of their homes. Headquartered in suburban Philadelphia, BAYADA employs more than 23,000 field and office professionals who serve their communities in over 20 states from more than 300 offices. BAYADA Home Health Care, Inc. is an Equal Opportunity Employer and qualified applicants will not be discriminated against on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or veteran status.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
