&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Marketing experience&lt;/strong&gt; (Senior Manager / Senior Expert level) in high-impact roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise across &lt;strong&gt;multiple marketing disciplines&lt;/strong&gt;: Media, Communications/Advertising, Brand Strategy, Product Marketing / Value Proposition, GTM, SEO and Content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Proven track record &lt;strong&gt;leading integrated campaigns and launches&lt;/strong&gt; end-to-end, from insight and strategy to execution and post-mortem, in fast-paced digital or tech-driven environments.&lt;/li&gt;
