&lt;div class=&quot;tk0j8o1 _1ibi0s31a _1ibi0s3do&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;base-ui-:r1d6:&quot; class=&quot;wdbi343 wdbi341 _1ibi0s3dd _1ibi0s376&quot; href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/15UUEfXWlDFeLJUnSHNeyuBIpfk4xs4Zg&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-label=&quot;2&quot; data-base-ui-click-trigger=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p8i6j07 p8i6j02&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p8i6j0a&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;crypto / blockchain / cross-border payments&lt;/strong&gt; businesses (e.g., Coinbase, DollarApp/ARQ Finance) or adjacent fintechs.&lt;/li&gt;
