&lt;h3 class=&quot;_9k2iva0 p8i6j0c _1ibi0s314 heading3 _9k2iva1&quot;&gt;Our Benefits – United States&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p8i6j01 paragraph&quot;&gt;For employees based in the United States, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
